# r1107tp boot a1: group A superflat, creativecompat-1.0.0 of 11-07 10:31 (Tempad member nested), tempad_upstream/ linked,
# Curios, FTB Teams, WTHIT present; Immersive Portals, Portal Gun, Portal Gels, loadingscreentips left out.
# Rows SQ-TP-01a, -02, -10, -18a, -27a.
pace 1

## SQ-TP-01a | boot with the donor present
bootexpect Done \(
shell grep -hiE "tempad" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "error|exception|fail|warn" | head -20; echo "errlines=$(grep -hiE 'tempad' logs/latest.log | grep -ciE 'error|exception|fail')"
> datapack list
sleep 2
expect tempad_upstream
look no tempad error lines; tempad_upstream_data in the datapack list

## SQ-TP-02 | phase 1 recipes, forge tags, new-location upgrade absent
> zq rdetail tempad:
waitlog \[zq\] done 60
expect tempad:tempad
expect tempad:chronon_cell
expect tempad:chronon_battery
expect tempad:chronon_generator
expect tempad:chronometer
expect tempad:time_steel_shaped
reject upgrades/new_location
shell grep -hE "\[zq\]" logs/latest.log | grep -E "tempad:(tempad|chronon_cell|chronon_battery|chronon_generator|chronometer|time_steel_shaped) " -A4 | head -60
look inputs use forge: tags (ender pearls, quartz, tinted glass) or items; no c: tags

## SQ-TP-10 | phase 2 recipes and items
expect tempad:card_cheap
expect tempad:card_expensive
expect tempad:location_card_clean
expect tempad:card_wallet
expect tempad:location_broadcaster
expect tempad:screening_device
expect tempad:player_teleport_upgrade
shell grep -hE "Error|Couldn't|Unknown|Parsing error" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "tempad" | head -10; grep -hE "\[zq\]" logs/latest.log | grep -A4 "card_wallet " | head -8
look card wallet with forge:leather; no tempad recipe/tag errors

## SQ-TP-18a | phase 4 compat boot (Curios, FTB Teams, WTHIT present), recipes
bootreject (ClassNotFound|NoClassDefFound).*tempad
expect tempad:knowledge_projector
expect tempad:knowledge_repository_upgrade
expect upgrades/knowledge_repository
shell grep -hE "tempad" logs/debug.log | grep -iE "curios" | head -10
look debug log drops data/tempad/curios but keeps data/curios/tags

